.TH SCHED_GETSCHEDULER 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_getscheduler \- reads a thread's scheduling policy; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_getscheduler(pid_t process);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a thread's scheduling policy; process zero selects the caller.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_getscheduler (2)
